/F1 10.5 Tf (Demo Bank Savings Account - Frequently Asked Questions) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Updated 1 March 2026.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 10.5 Tf (1. What is the minimum balance requirement?) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Regular savings accounts require an average monthly balance of Rs. 10,000 in metro and urban) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (branches, Rs. 5,000 in semi-urban branches and Rs. 2,500 in rural branches. Basic Savings) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Bank Deposit Accounts have no minimum balance requirement.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 10.5 Tf (2. What interest rate is paid on savings accounts?) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Balances up to Rs. 1 lakh earn 2.70% per annum. Balances above Rs. 1 lakh earn 3.00% per) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (annum. Interest is calculated on the daily closing balance and credited quarterly.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 10.5 Tf (3. How do I update my KYC?) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (You can complete re-KYC through the mobile app using Aadhaar-based e-KYC, by visiting any) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (branch with your original officially valid documents, or by video KYC. Re-KYC is required) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (every 2 years for high-risk accounts, 8 years for medium-risk and 10 years for low-risk) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (accounts.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 10.5 Tf (4. How do I add a beneficiary?) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Beneficiaries can be added in the mobile app or net banking under Transfers. For your) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (security, a newly added beneficiary is activated after a cooling period of 30 minutes, and) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (transfers to a new beneficiary are limited to Rs. 50,000 in the first 24 hours.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 10.5 Tf (5. What should I do if I notice an unauthorised transaction?) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Block your card immediately through the app or the virtual assistant and report the) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (transaction. Under RBI rules, your liability is zero if you report within 3 working days.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Never share your OTP, PIN, CVV or passwords with anyone, including bank staff.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf () Tj T*
